# CWMenu 4 - LINKED script (opened by the main menu's More row through the
# `open_script:extras.cwm|more_main` action).  This file demonstrates the
# linking feature: the host loads it INTO the state default.cwm built, every
# `menu <name>` block here replaces that menu, and theme/project/vars merge.
# A linked script may therefore re-skin or extend single menus without
# rewriting the whole shell.  This menu is a "modified main menu": the same
# row set as the stock main menu (page operations, open URL, settings,
# devtools, live page meta) laid out in the inline settings/devtools grammar
# - content panel, 42px rows, rounded chrome - so it can be compared
# side-by-side without touching the real main menu.
CWMenu 4

# No theme block: inherits whatever default.cwm set.  Adding one here
# would re-skin the whole shell while this script is linked (the demo
# of "rendering it instead of the main").

menu more_main
element window window 0 0 740 436 normal "" corner rounded
element header header 0 0 740 44 normal "CWebView"
element content-panel panel 20 100 700 300 normal ""
element content-title text 40 112 660 30 normal "More"
element content-separator underline 40 142 660 1 normal ""
# Live page meta strip (rendered live by the custom-menu pass: real
# favicon, title, url and control mode - the main menu's identity card
# restyled inline).
element page-label text 40 148 660 20 normal "Page"
element page-icon panel 40 172 56 56 normal ""
element page-info text 106 172 594 56 normal ""
element meta-separator underline 40 238 660 1 normal ""
# The stock main menu's row set, inline (42px rhythm like the settings
# tabs) - these dispatch through the SAME shared actions, so the rows
# behave exactly like their main-menu counterparts.
element content-row-0 text 40 246 660 38 normal "Page Operations" action page-operations
element content-row-1 text 40 284 660 38 normal "Open URL..." action open-url
element content-row-2 text 40 322 660 38 normal "Settings" action settings
element content-row-3 text 40 360 660 38 normal "DevTools" action devtools when devtools
element section-accent decoration 40 246 660 3 normal "accent"
# action bar + hint, matching the settings footer grammar
element menu-back button 20 404 160 28 normal "Back" action menu-back
element footer footer 190 404 530 28 normal ""
end
